# @slayzone/server extraction audit

**Date:** 2026-05-10
**Branch:** `phase-0-path-port-hardening` (post merge with main + cleanup)
**Status:** ~75% complete, architecturally sound

## TL;DR

The package exists, works standalone, has a clean CLI bin. All 21 domains are split into `src/server/` (transport-agnostic) + `src/electron/` (glue) with zero `import 'electron'` contamination in any server dir. Embedded supervisor + remote-mode switching + migration wizard are wired end-to-end. The remaining work is authentication, fallback UX, and a few small organizational cleanups.

