### Transport layer purity ✅
- `packages/shared/transport/src/server/router.ts` — no Electron imports
- `packages/shared/transport/src/server/context.ts` — typed only by `better-sqlite3`
- Electron-only operations flow through `appDeps` interface (`packages/shared/transport/src/server/app-deps.ts`):
